# Isobutanol biorefinery (nskinetics/biorefineries/isobutanol) #
################################################################
# Analysis outputs stay local, as they did in Bioindustrial-Park
# (analyses/results/publication/ is kept on disk but not committed). Every
# analysis output -- CSVs, figures, optuna .db/-journal stores, in-flight /
# seed / design sidecars, run logs -- goes under the flat results root
# analyses/results/ (or $NSKINETICS_IBO_RESULTS_DIR, outside the repo); the
# analyses/**/results/ rule also catches a stray per-folder results/.
nskinetics/biorefineries/isobutanol/analyses/results/
nskinetics/biorefineries/isobutanol/analyses/**/results/
nskinetics/biorefineries/isobutanol/plots/results/
nskinetics/biorefineries/isobutanol/plots/voronoi/node_modules/
~$*
# Binary inputs the package reads at run time ARE tracked (*.xlsx is ignored
# above; the negation never matches the '~$' Excel lock files).
!nskinetics/biorefineries/isobutanol/data/parameter_distributions/parameter-distributions_*.xlsx

